{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is reachable, retrieve it. Otherwise, approach it. Scan area for object. In order to inspect, retrieve. list of available nodes: <Action ID = RetrieveObject    /> <SubTree ID = InspectObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Sequence ID = FindObject>     <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    />     <Action ID = RetrieveObject    />     <SubTree ID = InspectObject    /> </Sequence> <Fallback ID = SearchForObject>     <Sequence>         <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />         <Action ID = ApproachObject    />     </Sequence>     <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> </Fallback>\"",
